# Collatz: halve even numbers, turn odd n into 3n+1, and count the steps down to 1.
# Which starting numbers take longer than every smaller number?
: steps 0 swap dup 1 - [ drop dup 2 % if 3 * 1 + else 2 / then swap 1 + swap dup 1 - ] drop drop ;
1 -1 bury
3 1 [ drop
  dup steps dup -1 dig > if
    dup -1 bury over . ." takes " . ." steps to fall to 1, a new record" 10 emit
  else drop then
  1 + dup 20000 < ] drop drop
